<title>USA: Northern Trust sets stock split.</title>
<headline>Northern Trust sets stock split.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Northern Trust Corp said its board of directors declared a two-for-one stock split of common stock.</p>
<p>The stock will be effected by means of a 100 percent stock distribution, it added.  </p>
<p>Northern Trust said one share will be distributed for each share held on December 9, for shareholders of record as of December 2.</p>
<p>Northern Trust has 55.9 million shares outstanding prior to the share split.</p>
<p>The banking company has $21.4 billion in assets.</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787</p>
